# Repo layout

## Tests live under `test/`, never next to source

Mirror the module they cover:

- `lib/yard/**/*.ts` → `test/yard/<same folders>/*.test.ts`
- `app/components/<screen>/*.tsx` → `test/app/components/<screen>/*.test.tsx`
- `app/lib/*.ts` → `test/app/lib/*.test.ts`
- `scripts/*.mjs` → `test/scripts/*.test.ts`

Import `@/`. Do not colocate `*.test.ts` beside `lib/` or `app/`.

```typescript
// lib/yard/tools/packages.ts  →  test/yard/tools/catalog.test.ts
// app/components/crane/AgentDashboard.tsx  →  test/app/components/crane/AgentDashboard.test.tsx
// app/lib/yardFetch.ts  →  test/app/lib/yardFetch.test.ts
```

## Folders

- `lib/yard/{door,host,crane,tools,observe}` — host I/O. Import leaf modules, not `@/lib/yard`.
- `app/components/{shared,yard,crane,host,operators}` — nest by screen, not `ui/`/`forms/`/`charts/`.
- `assets/` — brand at the root (`logo.svg`, `banner.svg`, `banner.png`). Console shots in `assets/docs/` (`scripts/shot.mjs`).
- `app/lib/` — browser helpers (`yardFetch`, `jpegFromFile`, `phonePreview`). Not components.
- Pages stay thin route shells. Coverage stays on `lib/yard`.
